        "markdown": "## Concrete episode checklist\n\nRequired: title, publication date, summary, parent work reference, and at least one real Experience target.\n\nOptional: ordered Segment nodes, episode-specific Media, Resource nodes for transcript and show notes, and Milestones only for meaningful changes.\n\nNever use sourceRef for a citation URL. Use referenceUri or a Resource node."
